## Executive Summary

Q2 2024 continued our strong momentum with revenue of $36.8 million, representing 79.5% year-over-year growth and 13.2% quarter-over-quarter growth. We officially launched MedSync Payor, our fourth product line, which exceeded initial expectations with strong early adoption from insurance providers.

### Key Metrics

| Metric | Q2 2024 | Q1 2024 | Q2 2023 | QoQ Change | YoY Change |
|--------|---------|---------|---------|------------|------------|
| Revenue | $36.8M | $32.5M | $20.5M | +13.2% | +79.5% |
| Gross Profit | $27.2M | $24.1M | $14.8M | +12.9% | +83.8% |
| Gross Margin | 73.9% | 74.2% | 72.2% | -0.3 pts | +1.7 pts |
| Operating Income | $2.5M | $1.8M | ($2.8M) | +38.9% | — |
| ARR (end of period) | $152.8M | $138.5M | $75.2M | +10.3% | +103.2% |
| Total Customers | 525 | 485 | 358 | +8.2% | +46.6% |

